From 6d85e595ae12e9bfabc81eb286c641e9b2242ca9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:43:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/22] Types: game-data.js is type-checked

// @ts-check (npm run modules marks its generated setters), and JSDoc types where the inference can't know:
gameData is GameData (the check under it stops the page without it), LOCATIONS and TRAINERS are the entries as
loaded (trainers, board, id filled in here), SPECIES, POOLS, EGGS, ROADS and ROADS_BY_NODE. Comments and
parentheses only: the syntax tree is unchanged.
